°ãh…¢˜ƒ¿A°MÅh?GÇ´rXö¬ëfQ§§a­×NàeÃl¶­¾Åw‰K¯D®©ÃÀg„n©ëóN.Ü™æÄLÜ8m¸{wà«Þ\‰×zT¸íÛ‹ñÔÔóÔ›lÈªõý*ô.Çk÷G'‹¡ù1™ì¸Øåu"×²íXÎÈÀo³œ¬‚ZøYIÅ/z¼E“MÇr>ƒV3c•£†x‡—Ÿñ*Öî¥×–ÛÛx[É‘{uŸÌ]º1ù6÷‘S2T˜‡.øúÈp £o3&—tø9q1Æ±²rÏ·ÊœeäÆCæþ?l ?§¥f”C ÊÁËÃPŽ)›ÑÆÜá¾Mw­€óâ+pÉqç1…?–›žî"½ÈŒ~—C~ëË×¼ÎñþDÞ%hÿw?´>%QãQg¹9¨íS|q­Âž ,OûºˆÉMÄž˜WÌ¯N-ð´åc+0{ÎeŒµýW<NZß_þ7Ò öËFþZè-‹É½$‹`yƒø]uÑ‡·uñ=@yU·1ÃqUôõþ‚¼KW—¶µÎX5f]ô´ÀÚŠÆW³[>_ýÁHß^L'ž×»ÜNj;jçþÅû
âZõü3kÃ2ôÌ°×³•1qÏ´âØÄ›`0ã«pÄ]iÎ`È»üYà•ö‰7çÅ	fý@û3ýQ¨Kµ5¿àyã3ÀzÃ~ôvØa/«;úÝ?©W<p¶13˜Ûçýx=Édè°äŽÜÊïûz²|Þ÷-ž÷£ãôá¼ìóyfC{ã9{}xGžp(\ö†§Ô¿8;oOþ¸/u¹le£ƒ—Ö¡2m␀␀␀␀␀␀␀shader_type canvas_item;
render_mode unshaded;
uniform sampler2D screen_image : hint_screen_texture, repeat_disable, filter_nearest;
uniform vec4 rectangles[32];
uniform int rectangle_count = 0;
uniform ivec3 xor_color = ivec3(255);
varying vec2 game_position;

void vertex() {
	game_position = VERTEX;
}

void fragment() {
	ivec2 point = ivec2(floor(game_position));
	int parity = 0;
	for (int i = 0; i < rectangle_count; i++) {
		ivec4 box = ivec4(rectangles[i]);
		bool horizontal = point.x >= box.x && point.x <= box.z;
		bool vertical = point.y >= box.y && point.y <= box.w;
		// Original edge writes XOR corners twice, including degenerate boxes.
		if (horizontal && point.y == box.y) { parity = parity ^ 1; }
		if (vertical && point.x == box.x) { parity = parity ^ 1; }
		if (horizontal && point.y == box.w) { parity = parity ^ 1; }
		if (vertical && point.x == box.z) { parity = parity ^ 1; }
	}
	vec3 background = texture(screen_image, SCREEN_UV).rgb;
	ivec3 pixel = ivec3(round(background * 255.0));
	COLOR = vec4(vec3(pixel ^ xor_color) / 255.0, float(parity));
}
␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀shader_type canvas_item;
render_mode unshaded;
uniform bool clipped = false;
uniform sampler2D visibility_mask : repeat_disable, filter_nearest;
uniform vec4 frame_uv_rect = vec4(0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 1.0);

void fragment() {
	if (clipped) {
		vec2 mask_uv = (UV - frame_uv_rect.xy) / frame_uv_rect.zw;
		COLOR.a *= texture(visibility_mask, mask_uv).r;
	}
}
␀shader_type canvas_item;
render_mode unshaded;

uniform float glow : hint_range(0.0, 1.0) = 0.0;

void fragment() {
	COLOR.rgb = mix(COLOR.rgb, vec3(1.0, 0.92, 0.76), glow);
}
